    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Quain are delighted to bring to the market this stylish 4 Bedroom detached home (c.158sq.m)in a quiet residential cul-de-sac a short walking distance from Athlone town centre and all its amenities. Presented in 'impeccable order' both inside and out, this fine home offers generous accommodation and is 'ready and waiting' to be occupied by its new owners.The property has a spacious cobble lock driveway with low maintenance mature gardens to the front and rear. There is double glazed windows throughout and oil fired central heating. The property has a C1 energy rating. Accommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall, Living room, kitchen, dining room with access to rear, utility and home office/study. Upstairs there are 4 bedrooms all of which are ensuite. The property is in turnkey condition.Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nVIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED:Agent: Liam Quain Sherry FitzGerald Quain"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.53m x 1.96m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.47m x 3.88m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.35m x 3.88m\n\n\n3.85m x 4.87m - \n\n\nLaundry Room - 1.98m x 2.78m\n\n\nStudy - 2.86m x 2.78m\n\n\nHall - 2.66m x 3.29m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.73m x 3.88m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 3.03m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.48m 2.89m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.78m x 2.31m\n\n\nCloset - 0.75m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.78m x 3.47m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.06m x 2.45m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.37m x 2.45m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.16m x 3.90m\n\n\n"
      },
